      <key>com.lihbr.kuronuri.source</key>
      <string>Drawn, the Greek construction: a stroke as thick as x's from top right to p's descender, straight, cut level at both ends, and one as thin as x's from top left to bottom right through it, a's tail at its foot and the same turned half round at its head; x's notches in the upper and lower crotches, cut along the thin stroke into the thick one</string>
    </dict>
